# Lantern character revision 02

56 complete character/creature assets in 10 revised packs: 30 fresh drawings replace 23 rebuild verdicts and 7 high-value selective repairs; 26 originals are retained byte-for-byte. No protagonist redesign.

## What is included
- packs/: complete revised selections, assets retain original filenames and IDs. Each pack has manifest and light/dark contact sheets plus 180px maximum-dimension gameplay proxies.
- source/: untouched native fresh generation outputs, including two rejected first gate attempts.
- prompts/: exact text for each fresh built-in generation.
- provenance.json: generation paths, prompt paths and selection status.
- selection.json and supersession_map.json: stable old-ID to selected art mappings.
- qa_report.json: integrity, grip/anatomy and implementation caveats.
- gate/: before/after and batch review composites; preview files only.

